cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ont-guide-aligner, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ont-guide-aligner"
abstract: >-
  Counts CRISPR sgRNAs in Oxford Nanopore amplicon reads, assigning each read to at most one
  guide by locating the vector flanks on either side of it, with rescue of reads carrying a
  1 bp insertion or deletion inside the guide.
authors:
